# Read API .dockerignore. Build context is the repo root, so this file
# lives alongside the Dockerfile for reference but the effective ignore
# set is applied at the context root via the repo `.dockerignore`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/TestResults/
**/.idea/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.git/
**/.github/
**/.claude/
**/dev_env/
**/testing/
**/docs/
**/infrastructure/
